<title>GERMANY: Daimler 9-mo sales up 4.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Daimler 9-mo sales up 4.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Daimler group sales			 75,913  vs 72,782</p>
<p>    --Mercedes-Benz			     56,900  vs 52,587</p>
<p>    --Daimler-Benz Aerospace (DASA)	 8,278   vs 8,914</p>
<p>    --Daimler-Benz InterServices (debis)  9,758   vs 8,572</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German industrial group is Daimler-Benz AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
